{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/cm1zka","slide":1,"text":"Say: DevOps Copilot helps an operator move from a production alert to a verified recovery. The important point is control: AI investigates, but people still authorize production changes.\n\nVisual: Actual product screenshot, captured from the project UI.\n\nLayout: Minimal cover. Title on the left, live product on the right."}
