{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/sv7d65","slide":3,"text":"Say: The issue is not a lack of tools. It is that the tools are disconnected. Alerting detects, runbooks guide, and AI can summarize, but the operating team still has to create the trusted chain of evidence and approval.\n\nVisual: Three-column comparison with one missing-layer statement.\n\nLayout: Use a calm comparison layout. The conclusion sits alone at the bottom."}
