{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/qniyt1","slide":4,"text":"Say: Our solution separates responsibilities. The AI investigates with read-only tools. Policy checks confidence and risk. A qualified operator chooses whether to approve, reject, or use the manual runbook. The system then verifies recovery and preserves the record.\n\nVisual: Three editable responsibility blocks leading to the audit and verification outcome.\n\nLayout: Strong center composition. Highlight the policy and human gates as the differentiator."}
