{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/v0q4a9","slide":6,"text":"Say: This is the full response path. The agent never crosses the authorization boundary during investigation. The flow becomes actionable only after the policy gate and a human decision. Verification makes recovery an observed result rather than an assumption.\n\nVisual: Six-stage process diagram with numbered nodes.\n\nLayout: Horizontal timeline. Use this as the central visual explanation."}
