{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/u2tetl","slide":7,"text":"Say: The architecture stays modular. React presents the product. FastAPI exposes the workflow. The agent uses read-only tools, with a deterministic fallback for demo resilience. The risk engine, verifier and SQLite ledger provide the controlled system of record.\n\nVisual: Four-layer editable architecture plus a visible safety boundary.\n\nLayout: Vertical stack on the left and safety statement on the right."}
