{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/s3gr94","slide":9,"text":"Say: For the live demo, I will launch the database regression scenario. The audience immediately sees a guided path. We investigate, explain the evidence, show the confidence and risk gate, make a human choice, and end with verified recovery and an audit record.\n\nVisual: Actual product screenshot plus five demo beats.\n\nLayout: Screenshot occupies the left side. The exact talk track sits on the right."}
