{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/k8eob4","slide":11,"text":"Say: The roadmap is deliberately realistic. First we connect the adapters to live signals and notification systems. Next we add identity, shared storage and organization-specific controls. Later we can learn from post-incident records and map dependencies from real topology data.\n\nVisual: Three-horizon roadmap with one clear statement of current prototype scope.\n\nLayout: Use simple vertical columns, no speculative metrics."}
