{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ucqk67","slide":12,"text":"Say: DevOps Copilot turns an incident into a controlled, explainable response loop. It keeps people in control of production changes while giving them the speed and clarity of AI-assisted investigation. Thank you.\n\nVisual: Closing statement with a three-word safety motif.\n\nLayout: Minimal final slide. Pause after the takeaway before inviting questions."}